title: "Non-compensatory Biological Dynamics"
type: software
version: "1.0.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/krilito/noncompensatory-biological-dynamics"
abstract: >-
  Public reproducibility code for non-compensatory evaluation of state,
  movement and meaning in learned biological dynamics. MELD-ICB is the
  frozen real-data evaluation object; the software does not implement a
  complete biological world model.
